      "name": "Backdoor Bandit (BB) (Updated)",
      "slug": "backdoor-bandit-bb-updated",
      "teaser": "Updated Backdoor Bandit to SPT version 3.11",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2575.png",
      "downloads": 40214,
      "favourites_count": 4,
      "description": "<p>This file is an updated version of <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1154-backdoor-bandit-bb/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Backdoor Bandit</a> by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18746-props/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Props</a>, originally published under the MIT License. All credit for the original work goes to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18746-props/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Props</a>.</p>\n<p>For information on how to use this mod, please refer to its <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1154-backdoor-bandit-bb/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">original mod page</a>.</p>\n<p>I have not tested every aspect of the mod, but I can confirm that Plebmode, Semi-Plebmode and the breaching Slug from traders work as expected.</p>\n<p>Everything is working as it should in my testing. (Semi-) Plebmode and normal mode are working fine. Breaching slugs and C4 work as expected. On normal doors and doors that need a keycard (labs).</p>\n<p>Differences from the original Mod:</p>\n<p>- C4 can be crafted at a level 2 workbench</p>\n<p>ToDo:</p>\n<p>- FIKA compatability</p>\n<p>- Update to 3.11</p>\n<p>Known issues:</p>\n<p>- C4 breaching not working (working on a fix) Fixed in 1.10.3</p>\n<p>- Every door can be opened, even doors that are not meant to be open (doors that lead to nothing / empty rooms)</p>\n",
